---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="404 · 这一页是空白的 — Lemon"
  description="你要找的东西可能搬走了、改名了，或者从来就没存在过。"
  variant="minimal"
>
  <div class="app notfound-page">
    <section class="nf">
      <div class="nf-stamp mono">PAGE · 404</div>

      <div class="nf-number" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>4</span>
        <span class="nf-dot">·</span>
        <span>0</span>
        <span class="nf-dot">·</span>
        <span>4</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="nf-title">这一页是空白的。</h1>

      <p class="nf-body">
        你要找的东西可能搬走了、改名了，或者从来就没存在过。<br />
        没关系，翻回去就好。
      </p>

      <div class="nf-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="nf-links">
        <a class="nf-link" href="/">
          <span class="nf-link-num mono">01</span>
          <span class="nf-link-label">回首页</span>
        </a>
        <a class="nf-link" href="/articles">
          <span class="nf-link-num mono">02</span>
          <span class="nf-link-label">看全部文章</span>
        </a>
        <a class="nf-link" href="/about">
          <span class="nf-link-num mono">03</span>
          <span class="nf-link-label">读读关于这个博客 —— <em>Lemon 是谁</em></span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="nf-margin mono" aria-hidden="true">
        ※ 如果你是顺着链接来的，可能是我搬家时忘了贴新地址。
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="foot">
      <div>© 2024 – 2026 Lemon</div>
      <div>HTTP 404 · Not Found</div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
